#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:6
msgid "Investor | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "投资机构｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Health, Hardware AI."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI软件、健康、AI硬件。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:10
msgid ""
"A venture-capital contact route with a published Shanghai office. Send a "
"concise investment case and confirm sector and stage fit. The general "
"contact inbox is not a guarantee of an investment review."
msgstr "设有上海办公室的风险投资机构。联系时可提交简明融资材料，并确认投资领域及阶段是否匹配；通过综合咨询渠道联系，不代表项目一定进入投资评审。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S048 <https://www.qimingvc.com/en/contact>`_. Contact Us | "
"Qiming Venture Partners."
msgstr "`资料来源 S048 <https://www.qimingvc.com/en/contact>`_. Contact Us | Qiming Venture Partners."

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:19
msgid "Funding mechanism: Equity investment."
msgstr "支持方式：股权投资。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official website / intake route <https://www.qimingvc.com/en/contact>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.qimingvc.com/en/contact>`_"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:26
msgid "Telephone: +86 21 61016522."
msgstr "电话：+86 21 61016522。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:28
msgid ""
"Published address: Room 3901, Jinmao Tower, 88 Century Boulevard, Pudong."
msgstr "公开地址：浦东新区世纪大道88号金茂大厦3901室。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map point is approximate, based on the published street context; it is "
"not an entrance or navigation coordinate."
msgstr "地图根据公开街道信息标注大致位置，不用于确认入口或导航。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:37
msgid "Confirm the manager, sector, stage and legal-entity fit."
msgstr "确认基金管理人、投资领域、发展阶段及申请主体是否匹配。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:39
msgid ""
"Submit a deck, cap table, technology evidence, traction and financing "
"plan."
msgstr "提交路演材料、股权结构、技术验证结果、业务进展和融资计划。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:41
msgid "Complete commercial, financial, technical and legal due diligence."
msgstr "配合完成商业、财务、技术及法律尽职调查。"

#: ../../entities/qiming.rst:43
msgid ""
"Review term sheet, investment committee conditions and definitive "
"agreements."
msgstr "审阅投资条款清单、投委会审议条件及正式协议。"

